1. Install program files
2. Install requirements using terminal in program folder: pip install -r requirements.txt
3. Install NLTK resources onto your machine:
    Open terminal
    type: python
    enter these lines one at a time:
        import nltk
        nltk.download('vader_lexicon')
        nltk.download('stopwords')
        nltk.download('wordnet')
        exit()
4. run the main.py from your terminal:
    python main.py
5. ctrl click the http to view the dashboard
